WANDERLAND
EPISODE 1 — "THE CHALLENGE"
Episode: 01 Working Title: The Challenge Format: 2D Animated Comedy Target Runtime: 8–10 minutes Frame Rate: 24 fps Setting: College campus Primary Characters: Ahmed, Sana Supporting Characters: Optional background students Story Function: Pilot / Character Introduction

1. EPISODE LOGLINE
When Ahmed casually claims he can beat Sana at almost anything, Sana proposes a simple campus challenge.

What begins as a friendly competition rapidly escalates into a ridiculous contest involving speed, academics, precision and improvisation—until the two rivals discover that the final challenge cannot be completed without working together.

And naturally, neither of them is willing to admit that the other helped.

2. EPISODE PURPOSE
This first episode establishes:

Ahmed's confidence
Sana's sharpness
Their competitive relationship
Their friendship beneath the rivalry
Their contrasting approaches to problems
Their humor
Their ability to cooperate
The college environment
The recurring competition engine of the series
The audience should finish the episode understanding:

Ahmed and Sana are equally capable—and together they are dangerous.

