25. EDITING RHYTHM
The episode should feel energetic without becoming visually chaotic.

Recommended rhythm:

Dialogue → reaction → response → reaction → action

Avoid holding every shot too long.

Important comedy lines should receive a short reaction beat.

26. DIRECTOR'S PERFORMANCE NOTES
Ahmed
Never play him as stupid.

He is genuinely intelligent.

His problem is that he is too confident and too fast.

Sana
Never play her as merely "the smart girl."

She is physically capable, adventurous and competitive.

Her intelligence is only one part of her character.

Together
Their chemistry should feel effortless.

They should appear comfortable teasing each other because the friendship underneath the rivalry is already strong.

